[{:adr/authoritative_for ["kotoba-lang/num gains N-D tensors, broadcasting, reshape, axis reductions (Phase 1),\n    and a real live GPU backend (Phase 2: Deno + native WebGPU (navigator.gpu) -> wgpu ->\n    Metal, promoting the already-verified verify/metal_contract.js pattern into num's own\n    IBackend/IGpuDevice, not just a standalone test)" "new safetensors reader, pure .cljc (Phase 3), loading real HuggingFace-published\n    TRELLIS/Hunyuan3D-2/UniRig checkpoint format (JSON header + raw tensor bytes, no\n    pickle) into Phase-1 N-D tensors" "kotoba-lang/torch gains its first real execution engine (Phase 3.5): an IBackend wired\n    to num, so torch.core/run stops throwing 'shape-only' and actually computes" "attention (Phase 4), conv3d (Phase 5), sparse convolution + forward-only rasterization\n    (Phase 6, hardest/most novel) are DESIGNED here but explicitly NOT implemented in this\n    pass — do not treat this ADR as claiming TRELLIS/Hunyuan3D-2/UniRig can run yet" "motivated by evaluating the real, already-existing 11-node Mac mini M4 16GB fleet\n    (kotoba-lang/murakumo/fleet.edn) as an alternative to the unbuilt cloud H100/A100 fleet\n    (ADR-2607031600) for kami-gen-ml3d (ADR-2607051120) / :autorig (ADR-0048 §2)"], :adr/supersedes [], :adr/superseded_by [], :adr/topic "kotoba-ml-engine", :adr/related ["adr-2607031600" "adr-2607022000" "adr-0048" "adr-2607051120"], :adr/status "accepted", :adr/id "adr-2607051400-kotoba-ml-engine-tensor-gpu-weights-kernels", :adr/doc_type "adr", :adr/last_verified "2026-07-05", :adr/body "see 2607051400-kotoba-ml-engine-tensor-gpu-weights-kernels.md", :adr/deciders ["Jun Kawasaki"], :adr/date "2026-07-05", :db/id -1, :adr/authoritative true, :adr/title "ADR-2607051400: kotoba-lang ML execution stack — N-D tensor engine, live Metal/WebGPU backend, weight loading, attention/conv3d/sparse-conv/rasterization kernels"}]